
1. We can execute using the run button normally.
2. Use Runner class by giving feature file path
3. Use Config file to pass values like we pass from the properties file in other frameworks
4. Sure-fire plugin is used to run the tests from cmd or terminal. After sure-fire plugin, we can't execute from Runner
class in Intellij as it needs paid version.
5. Include the Runner class in the plugin as shown in pom.xml
6. Make sure that Global variable or default variable or dev env variable values should be same as mentioned in the
Feature file.
7. Here are the cmds below
A. mvn clean test -Denv=dev = This is to take values from particular env
B. mvn test -Dtest=Runner = This is to execute without mentioning env. It will take default values from the config file.

